SOAPBOX: Thanks to K6RO for the use of his station for this contest. What torture. 160M SSB, low power, unassisted near the peak of the solar cycle doesn't produce any sustained runs. Self spotting would have helped this contest. Missed many states and provinces. Heard but didn't work NE, MS, WY, and VE7. Heard some Eu, but not many. Worked EI, LZ, and YU, plus P4, P4, XE, and ZF down south. Heard PY, TI, DL, OL, and HC8 but they had trouble hearing me. Tnx for the Qs.
